  "content": "<div id=\"tocBlock\" style=\"background-color:#f4fdfb;background:#f4fdfb;padding:30px 32px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px 0;font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Contents</p>\n<ol id=\"tocList\" style=\"list-style-type:none;padding-left:0;margin:0;\"></ol>\n</div>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:30px 32px;background-color:#ffffff;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:15px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;width:24px;max-width:24px;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle;\">01</td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td width=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#29ccb1;\"></td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">New Web KORM: A year of foundation with SBO, Regional Sales, Channel and IT teams</h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 15px 0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Web KORM</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">2025 was a foundational year for New Web KORM, focused on the successful soft launch of the \\\"Quote Sharing Scenario\\\" and preparing our global user base.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font:bold 16px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#00A88E;\">2025 regional launch timeline</h3>\n<ul style=\"font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;margin:0 0 12px 0;padding-left:20px;\">\n<li><strong>DACH</strong>: June 1</li>\n<li><strong>META</strong>: July 15</li>\n<li><strong>Europe</strong>: September 15</li>\n<li><strong>APAC</strong>: October 15</li>\n<li><strong>LATAM</strong>: November 15</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font:bold 16px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#00A88E;\">Key launch metrics</h3>\n<ul style=\"font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;margin:0 0 12px 0;padding-left:20px;\">\n<li>Total orders placed from shared quotes: <strong>1,508</strong></li>\n<li>Orders placed specifically via New Web KORM: <strong>773</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">This results in a New Web KORM adoption rate of <strong>51.25%</strong> for this period.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">A huge thank you to all teams involved for your crucial role in making this launch a success.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px 0 0 0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"><a href=\"#\" style=\"font:bold 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#00a88e;text-decoration:none;\">Learn more</a></td>\n<td width=\"8\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"><img src=\"https://partners.kaspersky.com/resources/digest/arrow.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" border=\"0\" alt=\"arrow\" style=\"display:block;\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:30px 32px;background-color:#f4fdfb;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:15px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;width:24px;max-width:24px;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle;\">02</td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td width=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#29ccb1;\"></td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Deal Price change: Trial period disabled</h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 15px 0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">KORM</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Starting 1 February 2025, the Trial period option has been removed from the Deal Price workflow in KORM. Partners can no longer set a trial period when submitting a deal for approval.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">If a partner requires a trial period arrangement, this should now be handled through the standard commercial agreement process. Please update any training materials or user guides that reference the Trial period field.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px 0 0 0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"><a href=\"#\" style=\"font:bold 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#00a88e;text-decoration:none;\">Learn more</a></td>\n<td width=\"8\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"><img src=\"https://partners.kaspersky.com/resources/digest/arrow.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" border=\"0\" alt=\"arrow\" style=\"display:block;\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:30px 32px;background-color:#ffffff;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:15px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;width:24px;max-width:24px;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle;\">03</td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td width=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#29ccb1;\"></td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Improving sales systems together: Feedback and comments on NPS Survey</h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 15px 0;border-spacing:0 4px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">CRM</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"6\"></td>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">ELMA</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"6\"></td>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">KORM (B2B)</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"6\"></td>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">KORM (B2C)</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">In 2025, we fulfilled a number of requests to make your day-to-day work easier. Below is a summary of the top Jira requests completed across all four systems.</p>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:12px 0;border:1px solid #ddd;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"padding:10px 14px;background:#f0f4f8;font:bold 12px/16px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;border-bottom:2px solid #c8d0da;color:#333;\">System</th>\n<th style=\"padding:10px 14px;background:#f0f4f8;font:bold 12px/16px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;border-bottom:2px solid #c8d0da;color:#333;\">Requests completed</th>\n<th style=\"padding:10px 14px;background:#f0f4f8;font:bold 12px/16px Arial,sans-serif;text-align:left;border-bottom:2px solid #c8d0da;color:#333;\">Key improvement</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:9px 14px;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;color:#333;\">CRM</td>\n<td style=\"padding:9px 14px;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;color:#333;\">47</td>\n<td style=\"padding:9px 14px;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;color:#333;\">Lead deduplication rules</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:9px 14px;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;color:#333;background:#fafafa;\">ELMA</td>\n<td style=\"padding:9px 14px;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;color:#333;background:#fafafa;\">31</td>\n<td style=\"padding:9px 14px;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e5e5;color:#333;background:#fafafa;\">Process automation workflows</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:9px 14px;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#333;\">KORM</td>\n<td style=\"padding:9px 14px;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#333;\">58</td>\n<td style=\"padding:9px 14px;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#333;\">Quote sharing + deal approval</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:30px 32px;background-color:#f4fdfb;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:15px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;width:24px;max-width:24px;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle;\">04</td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td width=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#29ccb1;\"></td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Top Jira requests and KL Academy progress</h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 15px 0;border-spacing:0 4px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">KL Academy</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"6\"></td>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Analytics</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">We continue to invest in the KL Academy learning platform. In the first half of 2025, over 2,400 partners completed at least one course, and the average completion rate rose to 78%.</p>\n<h3 style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0;font:bold 16px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#00A88E;\">Top requested features delivered</h3>\n<ul style=\"font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;margin:0 0 12px 0;padding-left:20px;\">\n<li>Self-service certification dashboard</li>\n<li>Course recommendation engine based on partner tier</li>\n<li>Offline access for mobile learners</li>\n<li>Automated progress reminders</li>\n</ul>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px 0 0 0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"><a href=\"#\" style=\"font:bold 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#00a88e;text-decoration:none;\">View KL Academy statistics</a></td>\n<td width=\"8\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"><img src=\"https://partners.kaspersky.com/resources/digest/arrow.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" border=\"0\" alt=\"arrow\" style=\"display:block;\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:30px 32px;background-color:#ffffff;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:15px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;width:24px;max-width:24px;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle;\">05</td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td width=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#29ccb1;\"></td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">2025 is the year of deduplication: Data Quality Tool results</h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 15px 0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">CRM</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"6\"></td>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Analytics</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">The Data Quality Tool has processed over 1.2 million partner records since its launch. Duplicate entries have been reduced by 34%, and data accuracy scores now exceed 91% across all regions.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Phase 2 will introduce automated matching rules and real-time deduplication on record creation. Regional data stewards will receive training in Q3.</p>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:15px 0 0 0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"><a href=\"#\" style=\"font:bold 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#00a88e;text-decoration:none;\">Learn more</a></td>\n<td width=\"8\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\"><img src=\"https://partners.kaspersky.com/resources/digest/arrow.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" border=\"0\" alt=\"arrow\" style=\"display:block;\" /></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:30px 32px;background-color:#f4fdfb;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-bottom:15px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;width:24px;max-width:24px;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:middle;\">06</td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td width=\"2\" style=\"background-color:#29ccb1;\"></td>\n<td width=\"10\"></td>\n<td style=\"vertical-align:middle;\">\n<h2 style=\"margin:0;font:bold 20px/24px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">MOPS Team: Introducing the people behind your tools</h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0 0 15px 0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Mautic</p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"6\"></td>\n<td style=\"background-color:#d3f6ef;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:24px;\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:bold 10px/12px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Mindbox</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px 0;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">Meet the Marketing Operations team — the people who build, maintain, and optimise the marketing technology stack that powers our partner communications.</p>\n<p style=\"margin:0;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;\">The team manages Mautic (global email automation), Mindbox (Russia++ personalisation), WebEngage (APAC engagement), and the internal analytics dashboards. Reach out via Jira for feature requests or support.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin:0;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:30px 32px;background-color:#ffffff;text-align:center;\">\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;padding-bottom:16px;\">\n<img src=\"https://partners.kaspersky.com/resources/digest/contact_us.png\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Contact us\" style=\"display:inline-block;\" />\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font:bold 16px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;padding-bottom:8px;\">Questions or feedback?</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;font:14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#1d1d1b;padding-bottom:16px;\">Create a request in <a href=\"#\" style=\"font:bold 14px/20px Arial,sans-serif;color:#00a88e;text-decoration:none;\">Jira Service Desk</a> or contact us directly.</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"#\" style=\"text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://partners.kaspersky.com/resources/digest/feedback_button.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"44\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Give feedback\" style=\"display:inline-block;\" /></a>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<div id=\"footerBlock\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:20px 32px;\">\n<img src=\"https://partners.kaspersky.com/resources/digest/footer.png\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Sales Enablement News Digest footer\" style=\"display:block;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;\" />\n</div>\n",
